{
  "$comment": "Immutable preactivation early_insurance.producer_expectation is null. After genuine READY/adoption the controller creates a local immutable actual-owner expectation and passes it only to a copied helper spec. Actual root core binds exact profile, mode and authorization. Entry points remain refused in this preserved proposal until a separate proof-validating release sibling is selected; no current job or owner is fabricated.",
